        {
          "id": "the_three_pollutant_processes_and_the_chain_between_them",
          "description": "The run's whole pollutant scope, unpacked from `runspecpollutantprocess` and `runspecchainedto` rather than written down. 9101 is Total Energy x Running Exhaust and is the only ENERGY pollutant here, so it is the only one S18 divides by 1,055,055.9; 11609 is PM2.5 Brakewear x Brakewear and carries its own emissionrate rows; 10609 is PM10 Brakewear, which carries NONE and is chained from 11609. The chain edge itself is not asserted here: the per-row chain-input variable that carried it is gone, replaced by the `lnk_*` edge list.",
