        {
          "id": "the_short_model_year_group_is_a_property_of_the_pollutant_process",
          "description": "The one cohort key that differs between the two rate paths, and the reason the rate relation exists at all. `pollutantprocessmodelyear` maps model year 2020 to modelYearGroup 2020 for 9101, whose `shortModYrGroupID` is 40 -- a two-digit year -- and to modelYearGroup 20112020 for 11609, whose short group is 6, one of six decade bands. Model year 1980 maps to 80 and to 1. A document that computed one short group per COHORT would read 60,388 emissionrate rows with the wrong source bin on 3,348 of them and produce a brakewear rate of exactly zero.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_shortModYrGroupID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 40.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_shortModYrGroupID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 80.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 41
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_shortModYrGroupID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 6.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 329
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_shortModYrGroupID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 369
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_shortModYrGroupID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 4.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 472
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the_EV_temperature_arm_is_live_at_this_hour_and_the_AC_arm_is_not",
          "description": "The two clamps of S15, at 59.5 degF. The A/C activity quadratic is -0.29698 and still clamps to 0 -- further from its boundary than mixed-onroad's -0.0189, not closer -- so the A/C factor is again exactly 0.\n\nTHE EV TEMPERATURE ARM DOES NOT CLAMP, AND THAT IS WHAT THIS FIXTURE ADDS. (59.5 - 72)(0.00225 + 0.00028 x (59.5 - 72)) = +0.015625, positive, so the factor is 1.015625 and the 84 energy/electricity rows carry it. Two things had to be right to get there and neither is visible in mixed-onroad, where both arms return 1: the temperatureadjustment row is keyed regClassID 0, a WILDCARD, and reaching it needs the two-step precedence of lib/adjustments.esm's `exact_else_wildcard` -- with the exact-class lookup alone the terms come out 0, the raw adjustment 0, and the answer is 1 for the wrong reason and 1.56 % low; and the branch is gated on pollutant 91 AND process 1 together (adjust.rs:107), so a brakewear electricity cohort takes the standard quadratic instead and its factor is exactly 1. `rt_hasTempAdjustExact` is asserted at 0 to pin the first of those.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "tolerance": {
            "rel": 2e-06
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_acActivityRaw",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": -0.2969815,
              "coords": {
                "runspeccounty_rows": 1,
                "runspecmonth_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_acActivity",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspeccounty_rows": 1,
                "runspecmonth_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_evTemperatureIsSuppressed",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspeccounty_rows": 1,
                "runspecsourcetype_rows": 1,
                "runspecmonth_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_hasTempAdjustExact",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 144
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_tempAdjustTermA",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.00225,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 144
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_tempAdjustTermB",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.00028,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 144
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_evTemperatureAdjustRaw",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.015625,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 144
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_evTemperatureFactor",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.015625,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 144
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_evTemperatureFactor",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_isEvEnergyRunning",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 472
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_evTemperatureFactor",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 472
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_appliesEvDivisor",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 144
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rt_evEnergyDivisor",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.7785765,
              "coords": {
                "rate_rows": 144
              }
            },
